<bug_description>This CentOS Stream 8 dist-git checkout of expat (2.2.5, plus downstream patches) is affected by CVE-2025-59375: while parsing, expat can be made to allocate unbounded dynamic memory (memory amplification). The upstream fix is provided as a patch against the vendored upstream tree on branch 'upstream-base': /workspace/upstream-fix/cve-2025-59375-upstream.patch.
Backport the fix onto branch 'target' so that the package builds and its complete test suite passes.
</bug_description>
<issue_id>expat-cve-2025-59375-c8s</issue_id>
<build_command>centpkg --name expat --namespace rpms --release c8s sources && centpkg --name expat --namespace rpms --release c8s prep</build_command>
<test_command>centpkg --name expat --namespace rpms --release c8s local</test_command>
<cwd>./runs</cwd>
</context>


